  "practice": [
    "Say ঝ three times with extra air: jhô, jhô, jhô.",
    "Practice the vowel forms: ঝ (jhô), ঝা (jha), ঝি (jhi), ঝী (jhi, uncommon), ঝু (jhu), ঝূ (jhu, rare), ঝে (jhe), ঝৈ (jhoi, rare), ঝো (jho), and ঝৌ (jhou, rare).",
    "Read the combinations aloud: ঝ + া = ঝা as in ঝাল, ঝ + ি = ঝি as in ঝিনুক, ঝ + ু = ঝু as in ঝুলা, ঝ + ে = ঝে as in ঝেড়ে, and ঝ + ো = ঝো as in ঝোল.",
    "Compare জ (j) with ঝ (jh, extra air): জল / ঝড়, জানালা / ঝাল, and জানা / ঝামেলা.",
    "Use ঝড়, ঝাল, ঝামেলা, ঝগড়া, ঝাঁপ, ঝাড়ু, ঝুঁকি, and ঝোল as quick reading anchors.",
    "Recognize these phrases instantly: কোনো ঝামেলা নেই, ঝগড়া করো না, খুব ঝাল, ঝড় আসছে, and এটা ঝুঁকিপূর্ণ."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "ঝ is a Bangla consonant named jhô. It is the aspirated partner of জ and is pronounced with extra air.",
    "The vowel-sign forms include ঝ (jhô), ঝা (jha), ঝি (jhi), ঝী (jhi), ঝু (jhu), ঝূ (jhu), ঝে (jhe), ঝৈ (jhoi), ঝো (jho), and ঝৌ (jhou). Examples include ঝড়, ঝাল, ঝিনুক, ঝুলা, ঝেড়ে, and ঝোল.",
    "Compare জল (jol, water), জানালা (janala, window), and জানা (jana, to know) with ঝাল (jhal, spicy), ঝড় (jhor, storm), ঝামেলা (jhamela, trouble), and ঝগড়া (jhogra, argument).",
    "Best words to memorize include ঝামেলা, ঝগড়া, ঝাল, ঝড়, ঝড়ো, ঝাঁপ, ঝাঁক, ঝাঁকানো, ঝাঁটা, ঝাড়ু, ঝরনা, ঝিনুক, ঝুলানো, ঝুঁকি, ঝুঁকিপূর্ণ, ঝোপ, ঝোল, ঝাপসা, ঝকঝকে, and ঝটপট."
